<section class="faq" id="faq">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="section-kicker">FAQ</div>
<h2>Quick answers before you book</h2>
<p>If you are unsure, send photos on WhatsApp. It is the easiest way to get the right answer for your exact load.</p>
</div>
<div class="faq-list">
<div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q" type="button">How do I get a quote?</button><div class="faq-a"><p>Send photos of the rubbish on WhatsApp with your postcode and a short note. The team can then estimate the load and waste type.</p></div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">What is included in the price?</button><div class="faq-a"><p>The team loads the waste, removes it, sweeps up after collection and disposes of it responsibly at licensed facilities. Parking and congestion charges are not added as extras.</p></div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">Are you a licensed waste carrier?</button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. All Junk Solutions lists Environment Agency waste carrier registration CBDU195530.</p></div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">What waste can you collect?</button><div class="faq-a"><p>Typical collections include household rubbish, furniture, garden waste, electronics, white goods, household fittings, builders waste and commercial clearances.</p></div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">What can you not collect?</button><div class="faq-a"><p>All Junk Solutions does not collect toxic chemicals, gas canisters, asbestos, paint or other hazardous waste.</p></div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">Can businesses book a clearance?</button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. The service covers offices, restaurants and other commercial premises in Bromley, Kent and South East London.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>